        {
          "text": "“Olw'ebyo byonabyona, kyetuva tuli kukola endagaano enkakafu mu bughandiike. Era abakungu baife, n'Abalevi baife, ni bakabona baife, bagitaireku ebinkumu byaibwe.”",
